  "grammar_explanations": [
    {
      "slug": "past simple: questions with did",
      "title_form": "Preguntas en pasado con did",
      "title_target": "Past simple questions with did",
      "description_md_form": "Para preguntar sobre el pasado en inglés, usamos **did** al inicio de la pregunta. El verbo principal vuelve a su forma base (sin -ed ni cambios).\n\n**Estructura:**\n\n`Did + sujeto + verbo en forma base + ...?`\n\n**Ejemplos:**\n- `Did you celebrate the tradition?` = ¿Celebraste la tradición?\n- `Did anybody call you?` = ¿Alguien te llamó?\n\n**Respuestas cortas:**\n- Yes, I **did**. / No, I **didn't**.\n\n**Importante:** El verbo principal NO cambia. Decimos `Did you serve...?`, no `Did you served...?`. La forma pasada ya está en **did**.\n\n**Con anybody y somebody:**\n- `Did anybody enter the room?` = ¿Alguien entró a la sala?\n- `Did somebody invite you?` = ¿Alguien te invitó?",
      "description_md_target": "To ask about the past in English, we use **did** at the start of the question. The main verb returns to its base form (without -ed or changes).\n\n**Structure:**\n\n`Did + subject + base verb + ...?`\n\n**Examples:**\n- `Did you celebrate the tradition?`\n- `Did anybody call you?`\n\n**Short answers:**\n- Yes, I **did**. / No, I **didn't**.\n\n**Important:** The main verb does NOT change. We say `Did you serve...?`, not `Did you served...?`. The past form is already in **did**.\n\n**With anybody and somebody:**\n- `Did anybody enter the room?`\n- `Did somebody invite you?`",
      "grammar_structure": "Did + subject + base verb + ...?",
      "conjugation_table": {
        "name": "past_simple_questions_did",
        "headers": [
          "Sujeto",
          "Pregunta",
          "Respuesta corta sí",
          "Respuesta corta no"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "I",
            "Did I serve...?",
            "Yes, I did.",
            "No, I didn't."
          ],
          [
            "you",
            "Did you celebrate...?",
            "Yes, you did.",
            "No, you didn't."
          ],
          [
            "he/she/it",
            "Did he enter...?",
            "Yes, he did.",
            "No, he didn't."
          ],
          [
            "we",
            "Did we invite...?",
            "Yes, we did.",
            "No, we didn't."
          ],
          [
            "they",
            "Did they call...?",
            "Yes, they did.",
            "No, they didn't."
          ]
        ]
      },
